## English

BabyPack is a baby packing-list app. We care deeply about your privacy.

**No data collection.** BabyPack has no account, asks for no identity, and sends
none of your data to our servers. In fact we have no servers: **all your lists
are stored only on your phone**.

**No tracking, no ads.** The app contains no trackers, no analytics and no
advertising.

**Weather.** To show the weather for your destination, the app sends the **city
name you type** to the free Open-Meteo service (https://open-meteo.com). This
request is anonymous, is not tied to any identity, and no data is kept by us.
You may also enter the weather manually, with no network call at all.

**List sharing.** If you share a list, it is sent as a file (`.babypack`)
through the app of your choice (messaging, email…), directly to the people you
choose. It never goes through any server of ours and we never have access. The
file is not encrypted: only share it with people you trust.

**External links.** The "Support the developer" and "Suggest an improvement"
buttons open an external service (donation page, email or form) that we do not
control and which has its own privacy policy.

**Permissions.** Internet (weather only).

**Children.** The app collects no data, including about children.

Contact: andr0bdt@gmail.com
